  "limitations": [
    "Human mouse/keyboard widget input remains unqualified; semantic fixtures do not substitute for physical interaction.",
    "Small fixture scenes do not establish engine game performance or large-project responsiveness.",
    "World operations remain synchronous on the GUI/host thread; graphics still serialize GPU work.",
    "IPC is same-user local authoring, not multiplayer networking; no separate-process GUI attachment to headless owner or MCP packaging yet.",
    "Captures and editor controls lack durable retry receipts; reconnect clients explicitly inspect/retry supported world operations.",
    "General package manager, mature editor, production gameplay SDK and remaining roadmap systems are unfinished."
  ],
